# Files Vercel never needs to upload or serve (each deployment counts toward the free plan's 10 GB Deployment Storage;
# without this file every deployment carried the whole repo, ~37 MB). The site needs only the root pages, css/, js/,
# assets/, icons/, api/ (seo.mjs reads index.html, js/supabase-init.js, js/modules/seo-meta.js, api/_places.json),
# data/spots-fallback.json, sitemap.xml, robots.txt, manifest.json, sw.js and vercel.json.
